  (text "LTE add-on module for the MDB ESP32-S3-WROOM-1U board (rev 1.4.x). Plugs into the mainboard's J2 (JTAG socket) with J1 on its bottom side." (at 20 640.70 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 0ea4ab7e-ebc2-5f43-a362-1f2403fff4f3)
  )

  (text "J1 pins 1-4 = GPIO42 DETECT, GPIO41 PWRKEY, GPIO40 ESP TX, GPIO39 ESP RX. GPIO41 high = PWRKEY pressed (MODEM_PWRKEY_INVERTED=1)." (at 20 644.70 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 803e3bae-8001-51f3-a12d-de2f61f13cb3)
  )

  (text "DETECT: R8 pulls GPIO42 high when the module is plugged in; firmware reads it with the internal pull-down and skips the modem probe without it." (at 20 648.70 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid e4c7d844-6fbd-560c-9e7d-05c698e8c0c1)
  )

  (text "Supply: VBAT comes from the mainboard 3V3 through J1 pin 6 and R1 (0R), as on the mdb-slave-esp32s3-sim7080g board. C1-C6 buffer the TX bursts." (at 20 652.70 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 5396e8c8-e70c-5160-b194-874a7a21c755)
  )

  (text "The modem's GNSS input and USB port are not used and left unconnected." (at 20 656.70 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 14bc00d8-37de-567d-bf53-20bb117187ab)
  )

